body:
@Cunninger @harrisonofcline @yncat — quick ping. I picked this up and opened a ready-for-review PR: https://github.com/cline/cline/pull/13940

It scopes to the announcement + focus part of the reported regression (radiogroup + radio + roving tabindex), keeps click / shortcut behavior, and adds a focused a11y test. Local `bun run test` is green (484/484) and `tsc` is clean in both `apps/vscode` and `apps/vscode/webview-ui`.

Since this is my first contribution here, the `ext-jb-test-integration` workflow is showing SKIPPED waiting for a first-time-contributor approve — could a maintainer kick it off when convenient? Happy to iterate on feedback.
